Package: com.galaxybudsclient.budsrfcomm
Name: budsrfcomm
Version: 0.5.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: RFCOMM bridge for Galaxy Buds (GalaxyBudsClient iOS port), running as a background service on 127.0.0.1:8762. Includes a bluetoothd tweak for iOS 15.8.8 (19H422) only.
Maintainer: GalaxyBudsClient-iOS
Author: GalaxyBudsClient-iOS
Section: Utilities
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
